WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.732 --> 00:00:11.032
Retention is where you work your client list every day. Let us open it from the portal home.

2
00:00:12.243 --> 00:00:17.143
Tap Retention in the nav. It loads your clients with everything you need to keep them.

3
00:00:21.148 --> 00:00:25.048
Each tile is one client, with their status and weekly trend.

4
00:00:25.151 --> 00:00:31.351
Tap a client to go deeper. Program details, activity, and your notes, all in one place.

5
00:00:33.307 --> 00:00:38.607
Finish all eight Ongoing Setup items. Manually tick only completed work.

6
00:00:39.775 --> 00:00:44.075
Use Kickstart, Strategy, and Cancellations so nothing slips.

7
00:00:46.051 --> 00:00:49.351
Work Retention daily and act before clients drift.
